{"seq":2,"slug":"isotonic-applications","title":"应用：排序、剂量反应与 ROC 凸化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/isotonic-regression/practice/isotonic-applications","wordCount":1497,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"应用-排序-剂量反应与-roc-凸化\">应用：排序、剂量反应与 ROC 凸化</h1><p>保序回归最为人知的是概率校准，但校准只是它的一个立面。同一个「单调约束下最优拟合」的内核，在信息检索、药理学、诊断评估、生存分析里各自开出不同的花。理解这些应用不只是列举场景，更是看清同一数学工具如何被不同领域改造利用。本篇走出校准，展示保序回归的四类经典应用，每一类都回指前文的机制，也把它与相邻 hub 连起来。它承接 <a href=\"../calibration/probability-calibration\">概率校准</a>，与 <a href=\"isotonic-in-practice\">落地与边界</a> 的工程细节互补。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-一个内核-多种改造\">核心概念：一个内核，多种改造</h2><p>这些应用共享 <a href=\"../foundations/monotonic-constraint\">单调约束</a> 的凸投影内核，区别在于「单调施加在什么量上、损失取什么形式」。下图给出映射：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[保序回归内核&lt;br/&gt;单调约束下最优拟合] --&gt; B[概率校准&lt;br/&gt;打分→概率单调]&#10;  A --&gt; C[学习排序&lt;br/&gt;打分单调化]&#10;  A --&gt; D[剂量-反应&lt;br/&gt;暴露→效应单调]&#10;  A --&gt; E[ROC 凸化&lt;br/&gt;凸包=最优可达]&#10;  A --&gt; F[生存/趋势检验&lt;br/&gt;单调风险]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[平方或 pairwise 损失]&#10;  D --&gt; D1[EDxx 阈值估计]&#10;  E --&gt; E1[凹 ROC = 最优后处理]&#10;  F --&gt; F1[单调 hazard]\">graph TD\n  A[保序回归内核&lt;br/&gt;单调约束下最优拟合] --&gt; B[概率校准&lt;br/&gt;打分→概率单调]\n  A --&gt; C[学习排序&lt;br/&gt;打分单调化]\n  A --&gt; D[剂量-反应&lt;br/&gt;暴露→效应单调]\n  A --&gt; E[ROC 凸化&lt;br/&gt;凸包=最优可达]\n  A --&gt; F[生存/趋势检验&lt;br/&gt;单调风险]\n  C --&gt; C1[平方或 pairwise 损失]\n  D --&gt; D1[EDxx 阈值估计]\n  E --&gt; E1[凹 ROC = 最优后处理]\n  F --&gt; F1[单调 hazard]</pre><p>四类应用的对照见下表：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>应用</th>\n<th>单调施加对象</th>\n<th>目标</th>\n<th>与保序的接口</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>概率校准</td>\n<td>打分→概率</td>\n<td>数值可信</td>\n<td><code>method=&#39;isotonic&#39;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习排序</td>\n<td>特征→相关性</td>\n<td>单调打分、修交叉</td>\n<td>PAVA 后处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>剂量-反应</td>\n<td>剂量→效应</td>\n<td>估 ED50 等阈值</td>\n<td>单调 + 阈值读取</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ROC 凸化</td>\n<td>FPR→TPR</td>\n<td>取凸包=最优</td>\n<td>保序=凹化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>趋势检验</td>\n<td>有序组→风险</td>\n<td>检验单调趋势</td>\n<td>保序似然比</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"学习排序中的打分单调化\">学习排序中的打分单调化</h2><p>信息检索与推荐里，模型对每个候选输出一个相关性打分，用于排序。有时业务要求打分对某个特征单调——比如商品的「历史转化率越高，排序打分不应更低」，以防明显反直觉的结果。保序回归作为后处理，把可能违反单调的原始打分投影到最近的单调打分上，改动量在平方意义下最小。</p>\n<p>一个更微妙的用法是修复<strong>分位数交叉</strong>式的排序不一致：当用多个阈值模型或多分位模型产生一组本应有序的打分，却出现次序颠倒时，对这组打分沿应有次序跑一次 PAVA 即可强制单调，且改动最小。这与兄弟 hub 处理分位数交叉的手法完全同源，见 <a href=\"../../quantile-regression-methods/advanced/quantile-crossing\">分位数交叉</a>。排序质量在线上会随分布漂移，需纳入监控，见 <a href=\"../../data-drift-model-monitoring/foundations/why-monitoring\">模型监控</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"剂量-反应与有效剂量估计\">剂量-反应与有效剂量估计</h2><p>药理与毒理学要从实验数据估计剂量-反应曲线，并读出关键阈值——如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>50</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ED_{50}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">50</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（产生一半最大效应的剂量）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>50</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">LD_{50}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">50</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（半数致死剂量）。单调是这里的铁律：效应不会随剂量增加而下降（除非是 <a href=\"../foundations/isotonic-taxonomy\">谱系</a> 讨论的 hormesis 单峰情形）。保序回归给出的分段常数曲线，每个台阶对应一个「效应跳升的剂量区间」，天然契合「阈值剂量」的生物学直觉。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mn>50</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>:</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>f</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>f</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{ED}_{50} = \\min\\{ d : \\hat{f}(d) \\ge 0.5 \\cdot \\hat{f}_{\\max} \\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0968em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">50</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2079em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2079em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>由于保序不假设 Hill 方程等具体参数形式，它对曲线形状误设免疫——当真实剂量-反应不服从标准 sigmoid（多相响应、平台期）时，比参数拟合更稳。代价是分段常数不光滑、外推无定义，要报告平滑 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>50</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ED_{50}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">50</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时常在保序结果上再做单调插值或居中保序，理由见 <a href=\"isotonic-in-practice\">落地与边界</a> 的外推讨论。有序剂量组的单调趋势检验（如 Bartholomew 检验）也建立在保序似然比之上，与序数数据的分析相通，见 <a href=\"../../ordinal-regression-methods/practice/ordinal-applications\">序数应用</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"roc-凸化-保序即最优后处理\">ROC 凸化：保序即最优后处理</h2><p>ROC 曲线上有一个漂亮的结论：<strong>一条 ROC 曲线的凸包（上凸包）对应的分类器，处处不劣于原曲线</strong>。因为凸包上的点可以通过随机组合两个已有阈值的分类器达到，任何凹陷（concavity）都意味着存在更优的操作点被浪费了。而「把 ROC 曲线凹化（取上凸包）」在数学上恰是对以 FPR 为自变量、TPR 为因变量的关系做保序回归（凹版本）。</p>\n<p>这解释了保序校准的一个副产品：<strong>保序校准会自动把打分的 ROC 凸化</strong>，去除原分类器 ROC 上的凹陷，因此校准后的期望性能不会更差。这个「保序=最优单调后处理」的性质，也是 <a href=\"../calibration/probability-calibration\">概率校准</a> 里「校准不改排序但可去凹陷」这一表述的严格根据。诊断评估中读 ROC、算凸包时，背后跑的正是保序回归。</p>\n<h2 id=\"生存分析与单调风险\">生存分析与单调风险</h2><p>生存分析里常假设风险函数（hazard）随某协变量单调——年龄越大风险越高、剂量越大风险越高。在这类形状约束的生存模型里，保序回归用于估计单调的基线风险或单调的协变量效应，避免参数 Cox 模型对形状的强假设。做法是把偏似然的迭代求解（IRLS 型）内层套一个保序投影，正是 <a href=\"../algorithms/active-set\">活集方法</a> 里「一般损失 = 外层迭代 + 内层 L2 保序」的实例。这类单调生存与趋势方法在流行病学的暴露-风险研究里应用广泛，是保序回归在医学统计里长期扎根的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>保序回归的应用共享同一凸投影内核，区别在单调施加对象与损失形式。</li>\n<li>学习排序：把原始打分投影到最近的单调打分，最小改动修复排序不一致/交叉。</li>\n<li>剂量-反应：分段常数天然对应阈值剂量，读 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>50</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ED_{50}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">50</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 等，对形状误设免疫。</li>\n<li>ROC 凸化：取上凸包 = 保序回归（凹版），保序校准自动去除 ROC 凹陷、性能不降。</li>\n<li>生存分析：单调风险估计用 IRLS 外层 + 内层保序投影，扎根医学统计。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 内：这些应用的凸投影内核，见 <a href=\"../foundations/monotonic-constraint\">单调约束</a>；一般损失下的求解，见 <a href=\"../algorithms/active-set\">活集方法</a>；工程落地与外推处理，见 <a href=\"isotonic-in-practice\">落地与边界</a>。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：排序打分交叉修复，见 <a href=\"../../quantile-regression-methods/advanced/quantile-crossing\">分位数交叉</a>；有序剂量组的趋势分析，见 <a href=\"../../ordinal-regression-methods/practice/ordinal-applications\">序数应用</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"应用：排序、剂量反应与 ROC 凸化","id":"应用-排序-剂量反应与-roc-凸化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：一个内核，多种改造","id":"核心概念-一个内核-多种改造"},{"level":2,"text":"学习排序中的打分单调化","id":"学习排序中的打分单调化"},{"level":2,"text":"剂量-反应与有效剂量估计","id":"剂量-反应与有效剂量估计"},{"level":2,"text":"ROC 凸化：保序即最优后处理","id":"roc-凸化-保序即最优后处理"},{"level":2,"text":"生存分析与单调风险","id":"生存分析与单调风险"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"多维保序：维度的诅咒与可行路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/isotonic-regression/practice/multidim-isotonic"},"next":{"title":"落地与边界：scikit-learn 里的保序回归工程手册","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/isotonic-regression/practice/isotonic-in-practice"}}